{"appendix":true,"contribution_target":{"fingerprint":"sha256:2448a57acbd08e11ec52bf3f87af9c889cefcb0a640d0167a7ae206777558282","grain":"paper-statement","id":"Snaky-in-21-Maker-moves-September-25-2026#r35:conditional","title":"r35:conditional"},"credit":{"kind":"producer-declared","license":null,"license_status":"consult-source-notice","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","repository":"https://github.com/openai/math","source":"lean/formalization.yaml","source_registry":"index.json#/sources"},"detail":{"path":"../rows/81b53e3b3a438750eff7aae3.json","pointer":"/row"},"display":"Proposition","generation_id":"sha256:fda4c3462963b650c538e2177794811eb1c221b267efea4b091fd6e397533f81","id":"r:Snaky-in-21-Maker-moves-September-25-2026:r35:conditional","kind":"statement-detail","manuscript_id":"p:Snaky-in-21-Maker-moves-September-25-2026","name":"r35:conditional","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","printed_number":"10","printed_number_provenance":{"atlas_pin":"c0851ae4ba3e12b1170cd4cdae33b48fae15d9a0","binding":{"file":"build/route35.tex","label":"r35:conditional","line":150,"manuscript":"Snaky-in-21-Maker-moves-September-25-2026","statement_sha256":"bfb2b9f3d2484e6de24d078ff77166401e1b7cd7ba062a34d78e7b6bf9e2d80d"},"blob_sha256":"sha256:253ae0683558fd095a71d6f47ab0694d8d98b846c1a65d2bbf9b145d484af567","kind":"reading-page-computed","pdf_verified":false,"pin":"c0851ae4ba3e12b1170cd4cdae33b48fae15d9a0","renderer":"scripts/build_papers.py","source":"data/statement_numbers.json","upstream_pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb"},"printed_number_status":"recorded","reading_page":"papers/Snaky-in-21-Maker-moves-September-25-2026.html#r35:conditional","release_id":"openai-math","schema":"statement-map-web/2","section":8,"section_title":"The 35-move construction and its conditional interfaces","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:d27dacf3011c9fbb7b81739293b0c02b7c1447217bf8a5d9b9c340bd12b00597","file":"preprints/Snaky-in-21-Maker-moves-September-25-2026/build/route35.tex","line":150,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"bfb2b9f3d2484e6de24d078ff77166401e1b7cd7ba062a34d78e7b6bf9e2d80d","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Snaky-in-21-Maker-moves-September-25-2026/build/route35.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:d27dacf3011c9fbb7b81739293b0c02b7c1447217bf8a5d9b9c340bd12b00597","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Snaky-in-21-Maker-moves-September-25-2026/build/route35.tex#L150"},"statement_kind":"proposition","text":"\\label{r35:conditional}\nThe 35-move certificate has 616 cards, including its six base cards,\nand 1,837 placement terms.  Every card satisfies\n\\(A_i^{35}\\subsetneq T_i^{35}\\),\n\\(o\\in T_i^{35}\\setminus A_i^{35}\\), and \\(h_i^{35}\\le34\\).\nFour of its conditional interfaces are\n\\begin{equation}\\label{r35:conditional-table}\n\\begin{array}{c|c|r|r|l}\n i&A_i^{35}&|T_i^{35}|&h_i^{35}&\\text{region disjoint from }T_i^{35}\\\\ \\hline\n 557&\\{(-1,0)\\}&118&19&\\{(x,y):x\\le-3,\\ y\\le-2\\}\\\\\n 595&\\{(-1,0)\\}&222&27&\\{(x,y):x=-2,\\ y\\le-2\\}\\\\\n 603&\\{(-1,0)\\}&275&27&\\{(x,y):x\\le-3,\\ y=0\\}\\\\\n 615&\\{(1,0)\\}&686&34&\\{(1,-1)\\}.\n\\end{array}\n\\end{equation}\nEach row applies at any Maker turn with its required point owned and\nits entire envelope free of Breaker, regardless of all other ownership.\nFor row 615 there is also a Breaker-turn conclusion: if Maker owns\n\\(\\{o,(1,0)\\}\\) and Breaker avoids \\(T_{615}^{35}\\), then after any\nlegal next reply Maker wins within 33 further claims, unless already\nvictorious."}
